* "American Lead V", channel 1, stage 2 of 2: V1B, the mode network, V3A, V3B with CH1 MASTER and the output o1. Driven by stage_ch1.net's node z (VZ, V1B's grid).
* See stage_ch1.net for the modes (the SW_* here follow CH1 MODE too).

V VRAIL x 100 400
R R86 x dp 1k
C C87 dp 0 30u
S VZ z 1 0

* V1B (100k plate, 1k5 with 0.47u), C20, R35 100k.
T V1B z p1b k1b 12AX7
R R27P dp p1b 100k
R R26 k1b 0 1.5k
C C19A k1b 0 0.47u
C C20 p1b v1o 0.047u
R R35 v1o 0 100k

* The mode network (RYM1, RYM3B): R31 3M3 (Clean) or R32 2M2 (Fat, Tweed) with C23 20p to the node nn, R33 680k to ground (Fat, Tweed); the divider R30 / R34 with its tap t2;
* V3A's grid takes nn (Clean, Fat) or t2 (Tweed); R42 475k (the reverb return) to ground.
R R31 v1o n31 3.3M
R SW_R31 n31 nn 1
R R32 v1o n32 2.2M
R SW_R32 n32 nn 1e12
C C23 v1o nn 20p
R R33 nn n33 680k
R SW_R33 n33 0 1e12
R R30 v1o t2 475k
C C22 v1o t2 500p
R R34 t2 0 3.3M
C C118 t2 0 180p
R SW_NN nn g3a 1
R SW_T2 t2 g3a 1e12
R R42 g3a 0 475k

* V3A (100k plate, R44 1k5, C31 100u / C32 2u2 by mode), C33, R68 47k and R67 150k to V3B's grid g3b: R129 47k, J175M3's 47k (Tweed) and CH1 MASTER (100KA rheostat).
T V3A g3a p3a k3a 12AX7
R R43 dp p3a 100k
R R44 k3a 0 1.5k
C C31 k3a c31 100u
R SW_C31A c31 0 1e12
C C32 k3a c32 2.2u
R SW_C32A c32 0 1e12
C C33 p3a u3 0.047u
R R68 u3 a3 47k
R R67 a3 g3b 150k
R R129 g3b 0 47k
R RJ3 g3b rj3 47k
R SW_J3 rj3 0 1e12
R VRMS_T g3b wm 1
R VRMS_B wm 0 1
R WM wm g3b 1

* V3B (120k plate, 1k with 15u), C108, R140 22k to o1 with R189 8k2 / C112 250p, and R199 10k (Tweed).
T V3B g3b p3b k3b 12AX7
R R138 dp p3b 120k
R R137 k3b 0 1k
C C89 k3b 0 15u
C C108 p3b u1 0.047u
R R140 u1 o1 22k
R R189 o1 0 8.2k
C C112 o1 0 250p
R R199 o1 r199 10k
R SW_R199 r199 0 1e12
